                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2328f438-0600-320b-9e78-4fcb01c56749",
                        "entry_id": "51df5c7d-3293-3a37-a92c-cff266b8a7d2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "связанный с президентом; принадлежащий ему"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "42576cd3-79db-4dcf-9753-05123a329fb0",
                                "sense_id": "2328f438-0600-320b-9e78-4fcb01c56749",
                                "text": "Российская Конституция не допускает исполнения президентских обязанностей более двух сроков подряд."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2989294c-0228-47d2-ac84-d0103df4c1bc",
                                "sense_id": "2328f438-0600-320b-9e78-4fcb01c56749",
                                "text": "Во многих странах мира президентские оркестры — столь же неотъемлемый атрибут государственности, как гимн, герб, президентский штандарт."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0e9c3cc1-f67c-4c43-bfb7-b3ce0d89142a",
                        "source_entry_id": "51df5c7d-3293-3a37-a92c-cff266b8a7d2",
                        "source_sense_id": "2328f438-0600-320b-9e78-4fcb01c56749",
                        "target_lang_word": "presidential",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "presidential",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec308768-6280-3abb-847c-1aecf0114979",
                                        "entry_id": "f3875ef6-350e-38fe-b273-daa866271555",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to a president or presidency."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f583e42-eea1-4e9f-8a73-16d7ec89087c",
                                                "sense_id": "ec308768-6280-3abb-847c-1aecf0114979",
                                                "text": "Take the New Right's full-throated embrace of protectionism and industrial policy. This romance with protectionism started in the 1990s with former GOP presidential candidate Pat Buchanan, gained enormous traction under former President Donald Trump, and is still going strong today."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94685bf9-361c-3f8b-962f-6503b34ddaf7",
                                        "entry_id": "f3875ef6-350e-38fe-b273-daa866271555",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Presiding or watching over."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a86d699f-cd83-3933-acf0-8784e89fec51",
                                        "entry_id": "f3875ef6-350e-38fe-b273-daa866271555",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "With the bearing or composure that befits a president; stately, dignified."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "552cfb0d-54a1-4121-a10f-79872ca90323",
                                                "sense_id": "a86d699f-cd83-3933-acf0-8784e89fec51",
                                                "text": "I feel my age and supposed status mean I am permanently required to be in presidential mode. And I mean this in the old sense of “presidential”, meaning magnanimous, patient and generous, rather than in the modern sense of presidential, meaning being a corrupt, pussy-grabbing racist."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2a3fb504-1ac1-3ad0-b758-f99cd67eec32",
                                        "entry_id": "f3875ef6-350e-38fe-b273-daa866271555",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(of prayers) addressed to God on behalf of the congregation by the presiding priest"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7652cb97-8cad-4c57-ae15-a7078510846f",
                                                "sense_id": "2a3fb504-1ac1-3ad0-b758-f99cd67eec32",
                                                "text": "These prayers are addressed to God in the name of the entire holy people and all present, by the priest who presides over the assembly in the person of Christ. It is with good reason, therefore, that they are called the \"presidential prayers.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "26c9a0b6-0013-42ea-8b3c-5e90a92ad5f9",
                        "source_entry_id": "51df5c7d-3293-3a37-a92c-cff266b8a7d2",
                        "source_sense_id": "2328f438-0600-320b-9e78-4fcb01c56749",
                        "target_lang_word": "présidentiel",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "présidentiel",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "89576802-3b9a-31e8-989c-b44faa86979b",
                                        "entry_id": "b5182d13-cc2f-311c-9b18-861c5ae0ff4e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est relatif ou propre à la fonction de président, à la présidence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2dbe7089-89a4-4898-8639-5fb0b6980242",
                                                "sense_id": "89576802-3b9a-31e8-989c-b44faa86979b",
                                                "text": "En ouvrant la séance, M. Hibon, président sortant, adresse ses remerciements pour le grand honneur, qui, dit-il, fut fait à un amateur de présider les travaux de la Société en 1936, puis il prie M. Allorge de lui succéder au fauteuil présidentiel. — (Bulletin de la Société botanique de France, tome 84, page 1, séance du 8 janvier 1937)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68068caf-386e-4280-aee9-f46bcd8073b5",
                                                "sense_id": "89576802-3b9a-31e8-989c-b44faa86979b",
                                                "text": "Une patricienne italienne peut ripoliner la façade de son présidentiel époux, et tenter, en vain, de dissimuler sa confondante vulgarité d’activiste, sa vraie nature pointe toujours."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de6db1ed-c461-4126-931c-f67f81f77222",
                                                "sense_id": "89576802-3b9a-31e8-989c-b44faa86979b",
                                                "text": "Quand la Semaine de l'industrie sera passée et l’élection présidentielle derrière nous, il faudra donc agir. Au delà du buzz, c'est-à-dire du retour en grâce médiatique du made in France, il faudra dessiner un projet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae93a766-9f0f-4d42-9ef0-d4b92206a617",
                                                "sense_id": "89576802-3b9a-31e8-989c-b44faa86979b",
                                                "text": "[…], il faut opérer une véritable réinvention de la démocratie qui ne soit ni un calque du régime présidentiel à l’américaine ou à la française, ni une pâle copie du système électoral français ou anglais : […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
